{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《女神配對計劃2》即將隆重播映，5 位備受矚目的「女神」陣容——陳若思、何沛珈、俞可程、阮嘉敏及郭珮文於昨日齊聚一堂。陳若思更率先在社交平台大晒 5 人的互動短片，並感性留言：「今晚同我啲女神們睇港姐睇得好開心💖☺️」，為新節目強勢預熱！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8964df95-5e36-4af2-98e4-95db9ad03639.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265KtLdG6TOY1788229729.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8964df95-5e36-4af2-98e4-95db9ad03639.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從片中可見，5 位靚女一致以華麗的晚裝造型亮相，各自展現出迷人風采。身穿粉紅色閃爍晚裝的陳若思站在鏡頭最前打頭陣，帶領身後的戰友們擺出各種俏皮 Pose；隨後，5 人更興高采烈地玩起「接力送飛吻」遊戲，畫面相當甜美溫馨，吸引大批粉絲留言點讚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2272e7a1-36d2-4f73-8cf2-3141d4205835.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263DiaySIkPj1788229735.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2272e7a1-36d2-4f73-8cf2-3141d4205835.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"46baa278-9c21-4574-8499-6364c5babb8c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZGqiv9WsaG1788229742.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"46baa278-9c21-4574-8499-6364c5babb8c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:00:28.043269+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}